  <section class="content-panel reveal">
    <h1>About me</h1>
    <p>I’m Michael. I enjoy taking an idea that interests me and turning it into something I can explore, test, and improve.</p>
    <p>My current projects reflect two of those interests: table tennis and games. With ttlabs.no, I’m working on clearer ways to understand equipment. With Furrow &amp; Crown, I’m exploring how everyday life and large-scale medieval politics could fit together in one world.</p>
    <p>I’m also interested in AI and how it can support research, design, and development. I use AI tools throughout my projects, while staying involved in the direction, testing, and decisions that shape them.</p>
    <p>This site is where I share what I’m building—both the things already online and the ideas still taking shape.</p>
  </section>
